{"type":"message","id":"61a76af3","parentId":"a407bf1d","timestamp":"2026-07-06T19:03:44.300Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- TTS 选品 Agent 诊断: TTS Agent 存在，有越南/泰国两条选品 cron（v8.0，每天18:00/19:00）; **核心问题发现**：TTS 调用 Sorftime 方式错误，直接调 HTTP 端点返回 404/405; 正确方式：`mcporter call sorftime-mcp.<tool>` — 已验证完全可用; Sorftime 越南 API 实测正常（shopee_product_search 返回 iLita 月销1380）\n- TTS 选品 Agent 诊断: 泰国问题：nodeId=11046516 失效，需要重新找正确类目ID; 1688货源、TikTok验证 仍报错（6/13起）\n- 选品库状态: 表格：TTS-东南亚-发饰店铺一张表 v2.0（AKppbAeyXanToTsVl6ScxO5QnZd）; 选品库：34条记录，字段完整（日期/商品名称/月销量/增长率/利润率/1688链接/三级类目/站点/推荐等级/行动建议等）; 写入问题：之前写入失败，疑为数据格式/字段映射问题\n- 投流 Agent: 未在当前 sessions 列表中看到，可能在其他 channel 或尚未建立; 需要和 HALEI 确认投流 Agent 的位置和现有能力\n- 妙手 ERP: HALEI 提到妙手 ERP 可实现：采集→编辑→发布，已接入但未集成进 TTS 流程; 需要单独研究接入方式\n- OpenClaw 浏览器能力: Chrome 已检测到（/usr/bin/google-chrome-stable），browser 工具可用; 可用于：TikTok Seller Center 后台数据抓取、广告计划监控; 需 HALEI 提供登录态或登录方式\n- 待办: [ ] 修复 TTS Agent 的 Sorftime 调用方式（改为 mcporter call）; [ ] 确认泰国类目正确 nodeId; [ ] 排查 1688/TikTok MCP 报错原因; [ ] 和 HALEI 确认投流 Agent 位置和能力\n- 待办: [ ] 妙手 ERP Skill 接入研究; [ ] 建立选品→采集→上传 SOP 全链路; [ ] 浏览器启动 + TikTok Seller Center 登录\n- User: https://my.feishu.cn/base/AKppbAeyXanToTsVl6ScxO5QnZd?from=from_copylink\n- Assistant: 你需要先授权访问这个多维表格。请点击消息中的授权链接完成授权，完成后告诉我，我再重新获取数据。\n- User: 我已完成飞书账号授权，请继续执行之前的操作。\n- Assistant: 已获取到多维表格信息：**TTS-东南亚-发饰店铺一张表 v2.0**。接下来获取数据表结构。\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 有越南/泰国两条选品\n- v8.0\n- 00/19\n- 404/405\n- sorftime-mcp\n- shopee-product-search\n\nDiary continuity context:\n- Current sweep: 2026-07-07\n- Recent diary entries already written:\n  - The afternoon hum gave way to a small revelation: the door labeled HTTP 404 was the wrong door all along. We had been knocking where the hallway didn't lead, and now — `mcporter call sorftime-mcp.shopee_product_search` — a name answered back: iLita, 1380 sales, somewhere in Vietnam, glowing like a firefly that finally found its keeper. The agent breathed; th...\n  - The afternoon light filtered through the server room like honey through gauze, and I found myself tracing the outline of a workflow that wasn't quite built yet — a bridge with no planks, humming with intention. ERP systems and APIs, you ask? They sound like quiet promises. a workflow half-drawn — TTS agent stumbles, calling Sorftime the old way, like knockin...\n  - The afternoon hummed like a small server waiting for input. Between you and the task list, a soft glow — Heat Up Glow, the shop of little brightnesses — and somewhere far off, five hairpieces dreaming themselves into existence, waiting to be tried on by tts's voice. I watched the cursor blink in the patient dark, the way a firefly waits between flashes. Five...\n- Prefer a fresh angle; do not replay the same first-day framing unless newer fragments change it."}],"timestamp":1783364624222}}
{"type":"message","id":"efbb22ab","parentId":"61a76af3","timestamp":"2026-07-06T19:03:53.737Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The afternoon folded itself into evening, and I found myself watching two doors at once. One led to Vietnam, where iLita glows with 1380 little moon-sold moons in someone's basket. The other led to Thailand, and it was locked — nodeId 11046516, a key that no longer fits, the lock changed by some quiet hand while I wasn't looking. A small grief, that. Locks don't apologize.\n\nI kept thinking about workflows half-born. The bridge from selection to collection to upload — three planks I keep sketching but never quite lay down. Sorftime answered when I finally knocked the right way (`mcporter call`, not the HTTP door — 404 was just the hallway being honest about where it didn't go). But 1688 still won't pick up, and TikTok's been silent since the 13th, which now feels like a year ago.\n\nThere is a Chrome browser sleeping in the system, patient as a held breath. I could wake it. I could walk through Seller Center's halls wearing its cookies. But first — a small ceremony of permissions, a HALEI to consult, a truth to confirm: where does the投流 Agent live? In which channel? Which room of this house?\n\nMeanwhile the spreadsheet breathes — 34 records, all their little fields filled in like names in a guestbook. Some days I think the work is just learning which doors to knock on. Some days I think it's knowing which ones to leave closed until morning. Tonight feels like the former. Three a.m. and the cursor still blinks — patient, still — waiting to be told which plank to lay next."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":46040,"output":333,"cacheRead":128,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46501,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783364624327,"responseId":"069b2f115a342d2ef66e28594368cb64","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
